{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome Jigglers!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to jiggle your way into the chaotically fun world of Jiggle Ball? Get ready to punch, jump, grab and jiggle your way through an Intense team-based showdown!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every gaming session will be unique! With crazy Jiggling, hazards, maps and lots of goofy randomness you'll be sure to find yourself in hilariously ridiculous scenarios!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Filled with silly, slapstick characters and stupendously chaotic play spaces. Jiggle Ball puts the \u201cfun\u201d in football!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is all about simplifying sports and putting chaos at the centre of it all!\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Things you will find in this game</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online multiplayer with up to four players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local 4-player split-screen</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team based</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full keyboard and gamepad support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nipples</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character customisation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ball heaven</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of Jiggling!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>About the devs!</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi, we are Playing With Wires, a group of three students working on this game a passion project alongside our studies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a passion for games, learning and most importantly fun, We are welcoming everyone to join our socials and reach out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel free to join our discord, message us on Instagram or just send us an email. :)</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3797120?t=1773602691","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797120/c942324329920a88bf3a80561e394e614002dc8e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773602691","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797120/ea635eb86e9af3a4921010254af0cd3412893668/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773602691","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797120/ea635eb86e9af3a4921010254af0cd3412893668/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773602691","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome Jigglers!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to jiggle your way into the chaotically fun world of Jiggle Ball? Get ready to punch, jump, grab and jiggle your way through an Intense team-based showdown!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every gaming session will be unique! With crazy Jiggling, hazards, maps and lots of goofy randomness you'll be sure to find yourself in hilariously ridiculous scenarios!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Filled with silly, slapstick characters and stupendously chaotic play spaces. Jiggle Ball puts the \u201cfun\u201d in 